Package: com.nktouch.nkcrane
Name: NKCrane
Version: 1.3.2
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: NKCrane v1.3.2 fixes named-container launch crashes by removing broad POSIX filesystem interposition. The app-process runtime now pre-creates the canonical Library/__NKCrane_Containers/<id> root and legacy compatibility symlink, then uses the existing Foundation/preferences/keychain layer against the same data.
